 problem by creating a new project with default settings, using Vulkan as the rendering backend, and running it for a while until the error appears during scene rendering.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99877/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99877/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}